  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can run down the enemy. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Increase your Strength or Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</li><li>Your movement speed increases by 10 feet.</li><li>If you move at least 10 feet in a straight line towards your target immediately before hitting with an attack as part of the Attack Action on your turn, choose one of the following effects: Your attack gains a 1d8 bonus to the damage roll, or your attack can push the target up to 10 feet, provided the target you want to push is no more than one size larger than you. You can use this benefit only once on each of your turns.</li></ul>",
